		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Gnomish fey who steals mortal shadows. Has no shadow of their own.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 14, <strong>HP</strong> 30, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 claw +2 (1d4 + steal shadow), <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +0, <strong>D</strong> +4, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +1, <strong>W</strong> +2, <strong>Ch</strong> +2, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 6</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Shadow Evocation</strong>. As an action, create a quasi-real weapon, armor, or item of gear. Dissolves in bright light unless a mortal shadow is bound into it.</p><p></p><p><strong>Shadow Step</strong>. Move into a shadow within close and teleport a near distance to another visible shadow.</p><p></p><p><strong>Steal Shadow</strong>. If mortal, CHA 15+ or steal shadow.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
